  "uprn": "100023406332",
  "decision_date": "06/06/2006",
  "description": "Change of use from offices B1 to residential with conversion of existing ground floor offices into 2 X 1 bedroom flats",
  "site_name": "Atlas House",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
  "decision_target_date": "11/12/2005",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": null,
  "street_name": "London Road",
  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Major all other major developments",
  "lapsed_date": "06/06/2006",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - It is considered that this application for the change of use from offices B1, to residential with conversion of existing ground floor offices into 2 x 1 bedroom flats at 466 London Road would not harm the appearance the existing building and preserve the character of the conservation area, and would protect neighbours' living conditions. The proposal is considered to be in accordance with Policies ENV B.1.1 (New Development), ENVB 2.2 (Conservation Areas), E 1.5,(Development involving loss of  or changes in employment uses), H 1.1,(Location of new housing development),  H.3.5 (Release of employment uses to residential),  H 4.1(Housing standards and guidelines) and  H 4.2 (residential density)  within the Unitary Development Plan (December 2003).\r\n\tThat Officers be authorised to negotiate, under section 106 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990, or other appropriate legislation a legal agreement to secure the following:\r\n\r\nFinancial contribution towards:\r\n\r\n?\tLocal transport improvements.\r\n?\tFinancial contribution towards improvements to and/or maintenance of facilities and open space due to under provision of on-site amenity space.\r\n\r\n\r\n\tThat on completion of the necessary legal agreement, that the Borough Planning Officer be authorised to grant planning permission, subject to the following conditions.\r\n\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 4 - Conversion work shall not begin until a scheme for protecting the proposed flats from noise from the London Road has has been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority; all works which form part of the scheme shall be completed before the flats are occupied.",
    "Condition : 5 - Conversion work shall not begin until a scheme for protecting the proposed flats from noise from the flats above has has been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority; all works which form part of the scheme shall be completed before the flats are occupied.",
    "Condition : 6 - Before the development hereby permitted is commenced a scheme indicating the provision to be made for disabled people to gain access to and within the flats shall have been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority.   The agreed scheme shall be implemented before the development hereby permitted is occupied."
  ],
